      "name": "[Blueprint] [Roxy] Hammered to Perfection - Lv.50",
      "desc": "This Blueprint can be used to unlock Roxy's exclusive Tactical Prism crafting at the Smart Workshop. Obtained through investigations or purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\nItem Effect: When the Evacuation Countdown has less than 15/5/1 minutes remaining, Roxy's Impact increases by 20%/50%/100%, respectively.\nWhen holding <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Don't Catch a Chill</color>, each second of holding increases the skill's <color=#2BAD00>DMG and Daze by 10%/6%</color>, up to a maximum increase of 30%/18%. When the skill hits an enemy, the target's DEF is reduced by <color=#2BAD00>16%</color> for 30s.",
